stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> free
    free --> occupied: vehicle footprint confirmed in polygon (debounced)
    occupied --> free: vehicle no longer detected in polygon (grace period elapsed) or relocated away
    occupied --> occupied: same vehicle re-confirmed (heartbeat, no state change)
    free --> reserved: reservation created (booking / app)
    reserved --> occupied: reserved vehicle arrives (plate match)
    reserved --> free: reservation expired or cancelled
    occupied --> disabled: admin marks slot out-of-service
    free --> disabled: admin marks slot out-of-service
    disabled --> free: admin re-enables slot
